MF KVM
Copyright 2026 MF KVM contributors
Source location: https://github.com/ooropuloo/MFKVM

MF KVM is licensed in three parts. Content from third parties keeps its own
terms; it is listed in THIRD_PARTY.md, and those terms take precedence for
those files.

Hardware design files: CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive
(CERN-OHL-P-2.0), full text in LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt.
  Board, schematic and footprint data, KiCad files, Gerber, drill, BOM and
  placement files, case models (STL, STEP, 3MF) and the data files that the
  generators read.

Software: Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0), full text in
LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
  Python, shell and PowerShell scripts, the HTML and JavaScript pages, the
  firmware patches and the build configuration.

Documentation: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0),
full text in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.
  Markdown and text documents, PDF reports, images and renders.

When a file could fit more than one part, the part named for its kind above
applies: a generator script is software, the board file it writes is hardware.
